{"type":"message","id":"16cb58ee","parentId":"18336a56","timestamp":"2026-05-18T23:31:06.110Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-05-19 04:23:36 GMT+8] Exec failed (calm-cla, signal SIGTERM) :: Key 1: price=409.99\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f8e5d5f48a0c3cb551d4ffdfe4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 07:31 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f8e5d5f48a0c3cb551d4ffdfe4]\nVAN: const { TigerOpenApi } = require('tigeropen');\nconst { execSync } = require('child_process');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\n// 从Coze环境变量读取配置\nconst CONFIG = {\n mode: process.env.TIGER_MODE || 'simulation',\n tiger: {\n tigerId: process.env.TIGER_ID,\n privateKey: process.env.TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY ? process.env.TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY.replace(/\\\\n/g, '\\n') : null,\n simulationAccount: process.env.TIGER_SIMULATION_ACCOUNT,\n liveAccount: process.env.TIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT\n }\n};\n\nlet tigerClient = null;\n\n// 初始化老虎客户端\nfunction initTigerClient() {\n if (!CONFIG.tiger.tigerId || !CONFIG.tiger.privateKey || !CONFIG.tiger[`${CONFIG.mode}Account`]) {\n console.warn('[tiger-unified-feed] 缺少必要的环境变量，客户端未初始化');\n return;\n }\n\n try {\n tigerClient = new TigerOpenApi({\n tigerId: CONFIG.tiger.tigerId,\n account: CONFIG.tiger[`${CONFIG.mode}Account`],\n privateKey: CONFIG.tiger.privateKey,\n env: CONFIG.mode === 'simulation' ? 'sandbox' : 'production'\n });\n console.log(`[tiger-unified-feed] 老虎${CONFIG.mode === 'simulation' ? '模拟' : '实盘'}客户端初始化成功`);\n } catch (e) {\n console.error('[tiger-unified-feed] 客户端初始化失败', e.message);\n }\n}\n\n// 云端一键生成RSA密钥对\nasync function generateTigerKeyPair() {\n console.log('[tiger-unified-feed] 开始在云端生成RSA密钥对...');\n \n const tempDir = '/tmp';\n const privateKeyPath = path.join(tempDir, 'tiger_private_key.pem');\n const privateKeyPkcs8Path = path.join(tempDir, 'tiger_private_key_pkcs8.pem');\n const publicKeyPath = path.join(tempDir, 'tiger_public_key.pem');\n\n try {\n execSync(`openssl genrsa -out ${privateKeyPath} 2048`, { stdio: 'ignore' });\n execSync(`openssl pkcs8 -topk8 -inform PEM -in ${privateKeyPath} -out ${privateKeyPkcs8Path} -nocrypt`, { stdio: 'ignore' });\n execSync(`openssl rsa -in ${privateKeyPath} -pubout -out ${publicKeyPath}`, { stdio: 'ignore' });\n\n const privateKeyPkcs8 = fs.readFileSync(privateKeyPkcs8Path, 'utf8');\n const publicKey = fs.readFileSync(publicKeyPath, 'utf8');\n\n fs.unlinkSync(privateKeyPath);\n fs.unlinkSync(privateKeyPkcs8Path);\n fs.unlinkSync(publicKeyPath);\n\n return {\n success: true,\n privateKeyForEnv: privateKeyPkcs8.replace(/\\n/g, '\\\\n'),\n publicKeyForUpload: publicKey,\n rawPrivateKey: privateKeyPkcs8\n };\n } catch (e) {\n console.error('[tiger-unified-feed] 密钥生成失败', e.message);\n return { success: false, error: e.message };\n }\n}\n\n// 统一行情接口\nasync function getQuote(symbol) {\n if (!tigerClient) throw new Error('老虎客户端未初始化，请检查环境变量');\n \n const res = await tigerClient.quote.getQuote([symbol]);\n const q = res[0];\n \n return {\n source: `tiger-${CONFIG.mode}`,\n symbol: symbol,\n price: q.latestPrice,\n open: q.openPrice,\n high: q.highPrice,\n low: q.lowPrice,\n prevClose: q.preClose,\n volume: q.volume,\n timestamp: q.latestTime * 1000,\n delay: '1~3s'\n };\n}\n\n// 统一交易接口\nasync function placeOrder(symbol, side, quantity, price, type = 'limit') {\n if (!tigerClient) throw new Error('老虎客户端未初始化，请检查环境变量');\n \n const res = await tigerClient.trade.placeOrder({\n symbol: symbol,\n action: side.toUpperCase(),\n orderType: type.toUpperCase(),\n quantity: quantity,\n limitPrice: price\n });\n \n return {\n orderId: res.orderId,\n broker: `tiger-${CONFIG.mode}`,\n status: 'submitted'\n };\n}\n\n// Coze Skill入口\nmodule.exports = async function(params) {\n const { action, ...args } = params;\n\n // 首次调用时初始化客户端\n if (!tigerClient) {\n initTigerClient();\n }\n \n switch (action) {\n case 'generateKeyPair':\n return await generateTigerKeyPair();\n case 'getQuote':\n return await getQuote(args.symbol);\n case 'placeOrder':\n return await placeOrder(args.symbol, args.side, args.quantity, args.price, args.type);\n case 'cancelOrder':\n if (!tigerClient) throw new Error('客户端未初始化');\n return await tigerClient.trade.cancelOrder({ orderId: args.orderId });\n case 'getAccountInfo':\n if (!tigerClient) throw new Error('客户端未初始化');\n return await tigerClient.trade.getAccountInfo();\n case 'getPositions':\n if (!tigerClient) throw new Error('客户端未初始化');\n return await tigerClient.trade.getPositions();\n default:\n throw new Error(`未知操作: ${action}`);\n }\n};"}],"timestamp":1779147066108}}
{"type":"message","id":"31a93836","parentId":"16cb58ee","timestamp":"2026-05-18T23:31:16.457Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is sharing a Tiger Brokers (老虎证券) integration code for Coze. This is a unified trading API that supports:\n- RSA key pair generation\n- Quote fetching\n- Order placement\n- Account info\n- Positions\n\nLet me save this and analyze it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！这是老虎证券（Tiger Brokers）的 Coze Skill 集成代码。让我分析一下并保存。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_66f43b6ab46f451db2eebaf9","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/SKILL.md","content":"# Tiger Broker (老虎证券) Skill\n\n## 概述\n老虎证券统一行情+交易接口，支持 Coze Skill 调用。\n\n## 功能\n\n| Action | 说明 |\n|--------|------|\n| `generateKeyPair` | 云端生成 RSA 密钥对 |\n| `getQuote` | 获取实时行情 (1~3s延迟) |\n| `placeOrder` | 下单 (限价/市价) |\n| `cancelOrder` | 撤单 |\n| `getAccountInfo` | 账户信息 |\n| `getPositions` | 持仓列表 |\n\n## 环境变量\n\n| 变量 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `TIGER_MODE` | `simulation` (模拟) 或 `live` (实盘) |\n| `TIGER_ID` | 老虎开放平台 Tiger ID |\n| `TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY` | RSA 私钥 (PKCS8, \\n转义) |\n| `TIGER_SIMULATION_ACCOUNT` | 模拟账户 ID |\n| `TIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT` | 实盘账户 ID |\n\n## 数据源特点\n- 延迟: 1~3秒\n- 支持美股/港股/澳股/期货\n- 可直接下单交易\n\n## 使用示例\n\n```js\n// 获取行情\nconst quote = await skill({ action: 'getQuote', symbol: 'AAPL' });\n\n// 下限价单\nconst order = await skill({ action: 'placeOrder', symbol: 'AAPL', side: 'buy', quantity: 100, price: 150.00, type: 'limit' });\n```\n\n## 状态\n- [ ] Tiger ID 配置\n- [ ] Private Key 配置\n- [ ] 模拟账户配置\n- [ ] 实盘账户配置\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1672,"output":587,"cacheRead":32832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35091,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779147066109}}
