{"type":"message","id":"9ca5c40b","parentId":"9a451606","timestamp":"2026-05-19T01:18:56.621Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The SDK is trying to strip PEM headers and decode the base64 content, but the base64 content length is 1621 which is not a valid base64 length (should be divisible by 4). This is because newlines in the PEM are being counted as characters. The SDK expects the private key to be passed as a single-line base64 string without PEM headers, or the PEM with actual newline characters (not `\\n` escape sequences).\n\nLet me look at the SDK source to see what format it expects.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9339150dfb6245aaa16cc336","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport tigeropen.common.util.signature_utils as su\nimport inspect\nprint(inspect.getsource(su.load_private_key))\n\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1737,"output":281,"cacheRead":69824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71842,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779153528216}}
{"type":"message","id":"5554bc66","parentId":"9ca5c40b","timestamp":"2026-05-19T01:18:56.680Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9339150dfb6245aaa16cc336","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"@lru_cache(maxsize=10)\ndef load_private_key(private_key):\n    der_data = base64.b64decode(private_key)\n    try:\n        return serialization.load_der_private_key(\n            der_data,\n            password=None,\n            backend=default_backend()\n        )\n    except (ValueError, TypeError):\n        pem_data = fill_private_key_marker(private_key).encode()\n        return serialization.load_pem_private_key(\n            pem_data,\n            password=None,\n            backend=default_backend()\n        )"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":53,"aggregated":"@lru_cache(maxsize=10)\ndef load_private_key(private_key):\n    der_data = base64.b64decode(private_key)\n    try:\n        return serialization.load_der_private_key(\n            der_data,\n            password=None,\n            backend=default_backend()\n        )\n    except (ValueError, TypeError):\n        pem_data = fill_private_key_marker(private_key).encode()\n        return serialization.load_pem_private_key(\n            pem_data,\n            password=None,\n            backend=default_backend()\n        )","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779153536677}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c13d130","parentId":"5554bc66","timestamp":"2026-05-19T01:19:04.602Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see! The SDK first tries to decode the key as base64 (DER format). If that fails, it calls `fill_private_key_marker` to add PEM headers. The problem is that the key with PEM headers is being passed and the first `base64.b64decode` call is failing because the base64 content includes newlines.\n\nLet me check what `fill_private_key_marker` does and how the key should be passed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2d2bd3f580c545f1a80d859b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport tigeropen.common.util.signature_utils as su\nimport inspect\nprint(inspect.getsource(su.fill_private_key_marker))\n\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":293,"output":246,"cacheRead":71552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72091,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779153536681}}
