{"type":"message","id":"657e6108","parentId":"6427118d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:16:34.646Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now update the SKILL.md and save the config to SECRET.md.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f0ab0d16ee654d9a92681938","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/SKILL.md","content":"# Tiger Broker (老虎证券) Skill - 新加坡区\n\n## 概述\n老虎证券 Python SDK，新加坡区专属，支持模拟/实盘自动切换。\n\n## 环境变量 (OpenClaw .env)\n\n| 变量 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `TIGER_ID` | 老虎开放平台 Tiger ID |\n| `TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY` | RSA 私钥 (PKCS#1 格式) |\n| `TIGER_MODE` | `simulation` (模拟) 或 `live` (实盘) |\n| `TIGER_SIMULATION_ACCOUNT` | 模拟账户 ID |\n| `TIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT` | 实盘账户 ID |\n\n## 区域配置 (固定)\n- Region: `Region.SG` (新加坡)\n- 模拟: `Env.SANDBOX_SG`\n- 实盘: `Env.PRODUCTION_SG`\n\n## API 函数\n\n| 函数 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `get_stock_quote(symbol)` | 获取单只股票实时行情 |\n| `get_account_info()` | 获取账户总资产/可用资金/持仓市值 |\n| `get_positions()` | 查询全部持仓 |\n| `place_order_limit(symbol, price, quantity, action)` | 限价单下单 |\n| `cancel_order(order_id)` | 撤单 |\n| `get_today_orders()` | 查询今日所有订单 |\n\n## 依赖\n- `tigeropen` (Python SDK v3.5.8+)\n- `pip install tigeropen`\n\n## 状态\n- [ ] Tiger ID 配置\n- [ ] Private Key 配置\n- [ ] 模拟/实盘账户配置\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1165,"output":435,"cacheRead":89408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91008,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779156984474}}
