{"type":"message","id":"b865b520","parentId":"c8d8e360","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:31:19.665Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see there's already a 2026-05-19.md file. I need to append new content to it. Let me write the append.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2bc6cd2f9adc4c4baa003367","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-19.md << 'EOF'\n\n---\n\n## 📊 新数据源配置 (04:21-10:30)\n\n### Finnhub API\n- **5个 API Key 已保存到 SECRET.md**\n- 测试通过：AAPL $297.84, TSLA $409.99, NVDA $222.32\n- 60次/分钟，可轮换使用\n\n### Tiger Broker (老虎证券)\n- **区域:** 新加坡区 (Region.SG)\n- **Tiger ID:** 20159412\n- **模拟账户:** 21409378833585169 ($1,000,000 初始资金)\n- **实盘账户:** 1406653\n- **Private Key:** PKCS#8 DER 格式，已保存到 SECRET.md\n- **SDK:** Python tigeropen v3.5.8+\n\n#### 关键发现\n- ❌ 用户代码域名 `openapi-sgp.itigerup.com` 不存在\n- ✅ 正确域名：`openapi.tigerfintech.com` (生产) / `openapi-sandbox.tigerfintech.com` (模拟)\n- ✅ 签名验证通过，账户信息查询成功\n- SDK 方法名修正：`get_stock_quote` → `get_briefs`，`get_account` → `get_assets`\n\n#### 代码文件\n- `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py` - 核心客户端（需修正域名和方法名）\n- `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/SKILL.md` - 文档\n\n### 老虎配置清理与重建\n- 先删除旧配置（JS版本，域名错误）\n- 重建为 Python SDK 版本\n- 最终验证：连接成功，获取到账户资产数据\n\n---\n\n## 📝 关键对话记录\n\n### 09:12 - VAN 提供老虎配置\n- 新加坡区配置：TIGER_ID=20159412, simulation mode\n- 生成 RSA 密钥对\n\n### 09:20 - VAN 更新 initTigerClient\n- 新增 `env: 'sandbox_sg'/'production_sg'` 和 `region: 'sg'`\n\n### 10:07 - 账户查询测试\n- 沙箱 DNS 限制导致 `openapi-sgp.itigerup.com` 无法解析\n\n### 10:16 - VAN 提供新版 Python SDK 代码\n- 改用 tigeropen Python SDK\n- 环境变量从 OpenClaw .env 读取\n- 6个工具函数：get_stock_quote, get_account_info, get_positions, place_order_limit, cancel_order, get_today_orders\n\n### 10:17 - VAN 提供最终配置\n- Private Key: PKCS#8 DER 格式\n- 验证签名通过\n\n### 10:24 - 域名问题解决\n- `openapi-sgp.itigerup.com` → NXDOMAIN（域名不存在）\n- 正确域名：`openapi.tigerfintech.com`\n- 模拟账户连接成功：$1,000,000 初始资金\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 待解决\n- [ ] 更新 tiger_client.py 中的域名和方法名\n- [ ] 测试模拟盘行情获取（需要市场数据权限）\n- [ ] 配置 OpenClaw .env 文件中的 Tiger 环境变量\nEOF","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1435,"output":910,"cacheRead":107520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109865,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779157863206}}
