{"type":"message","id":"24ea1def","parentId":"11fe9e05","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:31:38.287Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All memory flushed. Let me provide a summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **记忆已刷新到 memory/2026-05-19.md**\n\n**本次会话核心记忆：**\n\n1. **Finnhub** — 5个 Key 已配置，测试通过\n2. **Tiger Broker** — 新加坡区模拟盘连接成功\n   - 关键发现：域名 `openapi-sgp.itigerup.com` 不存在，正确域名 `openapi.tigerfintech.com`\n   - 模拟账户 $1,000,000 初始资金\n   - SDK 方法名需修正\n3. **域名修正** — 这是最重要的教训，已记录到长期记忆"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":265,"output":165,"cacheRead":110080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":110510,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779157891628}}
{"type":"message","id":"e4ff84d3","parentId":"24ea1def","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:31:38.356Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f88fb50ad04c2a5cf57a2267ae\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 10:30 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f88fb50ad04c2a5cf57a2267ae]\nVAN: 更新把正确版发出来"}],"timestamp":1779157898353}}
{"type":"message","id":"b5153294","parentId":"e4ff84d3","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:32:03.542Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to update the tiger_client.py with the correct domain and method names, then share the corrected version.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9b21c4566f024e6392fb360f","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"import os\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\nfrom tigeropen.trade.trade_client import TradeClient\nfrom tigeropen.common.consts import Region, Env\n\n# ==================== 从 OpenClaw .env 读取全局配置（无需硬编码） ====================\nTIGER_ID = os.getenv(\"TIGER_ID\")\nTIGER_PRIVATE_KEY = os.getenv(\"TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\")\nTIGER_MODE = os.getenv(\"TIGER_MODE\", \"simulation\")\nTIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT = os.getenv(\"TIGER_SIMULATION_ACCOUNT\")\nTIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT = os.getenv(\"TIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT\")\n\n# 固定新加坡区参数（不可修改）\nREGION = Region.SG\n\n# ==================== 域名配置（已验证） ====================\n# 生产环境: https://openapi.tigerfintech.com/gateway\n# 模拟环境: https://openapi-sandbox.tigerfintech.com/gateway\n# ⚠️ openapi-sgp.itigerup.com 域名不存在，不要使用\n\ndef _get_env_and_account():\n    \"\"\"根据模式返回环境和账户\"\"\"\n    if TIGER_MODE == \"simulation\":\n        return Env.SANDBOX_SG, TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT\n    else:\n        return Env.PRODUCTION_SG, TIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT\n\n# ==================== 自动初始化客户端 ====================\ndef get_tiger_clients():\n    \"\"\"自动区分模拟/实盘，返回行情、交易双客户端\"\"\"\n    env, account = _get_env_and_account()\n\n    # 交易客户端\n    trade_client = TradeClient(\n        tiger_id=TIGER_ID,\n        account=account,\n        private_key=TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY,\n        env=env,\n        region=REGION\n    )\n\n    # 行情客户端\n    quote_client = QuoteClient(\n        tiger_id=TIGER_ID,\n        private_key=TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY,\n        env=env,\n        region=REGION\n    )\n\n    return trade_client, quote_client\n\ntrade_cli, quote_cli = get_tiger_clients()\n\n# ==================== 可直接调用工具函数 ====================\ndef get_stock_brief(symbol: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    获取单只股票实时行情摘要\n    :param symbol: 股票代码 例:AAPL,TSLA\n    \"\"\"\n    res = quote_cli.get_briefs([symbol])\n    if not res:\n        return f\"【失败】未获取到 {symbol} 行情数据\"\n    data = res[0]\n    return (\n        f\"【{symbol} 实时行情】\\n\"\n        f\"最新价：{data.latest_price}\\n\"\n        f\"涨跌：{data.change} ({data.change_percent:.2f}%)\\n\"\n        f\"开盘价：{data.open}\\n\"\n        f\"最高价：{data.high}\\n\"\n        f\"最低价：{data.low}\\n\"\n        f\"成交量：{data.volume}\"\n    )\n\ndef get_stock_quote(symbol: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    获取单只股票详细报价\n    :param symbol: 股票代码 例:AAPL,TSLA\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        res = quote_cli.get_stock_quote([symbol])\n        if not res:\n            return f\"【失败】未获取到 {symbol} 行情数据\"\n        data = res[0]\n        return (\n            f\"【{symbol} 实时报价】\\n\"\n            f\"最新价：{data.latest_price}\\n\"\n            f\"涨跌：{data.change} ({data.change_percent:.2f}%)\\n\"\n            f\"开盘价：{data.open}\\n\"\n            f\"最高价：{data.high}\\n\"\n            f\"最低价：{data.low}\\n\"\n            f\"成交量：{data.volume}\\n\"\n            f\"成交额：{data.amount}\"\n        )\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【错误】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef get_account_info():\n    \"\"\"获取账户总资产、可用资金、持仓市值\"\"\"\n    assets = trade_cli.get_assets()\n    if not assets:\n        return \"【失败】未获取到账户信息\"\n    account = assets[0]\n    summary = account.summary\n    return (\n        f\"【新加坡区{TIGER_MODE}账户信息】\\n\"\n        f\"总资产(净值)：${summary.net_liquidation:,.2f}\\n\"\n        f\"可用资金：${summary.cash:,.2f}\\n\"\n        f\"购买力：${summary.buying_power:,.2f}\\n\"\n        f\"持仓市值：${summary.gross_position_value:,.2f}\\n\"\n        f\"已实现盈亏：${summary.realized_pnl:,.2f}\\n\"\n        f\"未实现盈亏：${summary.unrealized_pnl:,.2f}\"\n    )\n\ndef get_positions():\n    \"\"\"查询当前全部持仓\"\"\"\n    pos_list = trade_cli.get_positions()\n    if not pos_list:\n        return \"当前无任何持仓\"\n    text = \"【当前持仓列表】\\n\"\n    for p in pos_list:\n        text += f\"{p.symbol} | 数量：{p.quantity} | 成本价：{p.cost_price} | 盈亏：{p.unrealized_pnl}\\n\"\n    return text\n\ndef place_order_limit(symbol: str, price: float, quantity: int, action: str = \"BUY\"):\n    \"\"\"\n    限价单下单\n    :param symbol: 标的代码\n    :param price: 限价价格\n    :param quantity: 股数\n    :param action: BUY / SELL\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        order = trade_cli.create_order(\n            account=trade_cli.account,\n            symbol=symbol,\n            action=action,\n            order_type=\"LMT\",\n            quantity=quantity,\n            limit_price=price\n        )\n        trade_cli.place_order(order)\n        return f\"【下单成功】订单ID：{order.id} | {action} {symbol} 限价{price} 数量{quantity}股\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【下单失败】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef place_order_market(symbol: str, quantity: int, action: str = \"BUY\"):\n    \"\"\"\n    市价单下单\n    :param symbol: 标的代码\n    :param quantity: 股数\n    :param action: BUY / SELL\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        order = trade_cli.create_order(\n            account=trade_cli.account,\n            symbol=symbol,\n            action=action,\n            order_type=\"MKT\",\n            quantity=quantity\n        )\n        trade_cli.place_order(order)\n        return f\"【下单成功】订单ID：{order.id} | {action} {symbol} 市价 数量{quantity}股\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【下单失败】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef cancel_order(order_id: str):\n    \"\"\"根据订单ID撤单\"\"\"\n    try:\n        res = trade_cli.cancel_order(order_id)\n        return f\"【撤单成功】订单{order_id}已撤销\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【撤单失败】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef get_today_orders():\n    \"\"\"查询今日所有订单\"\"\"\n    orders = trade_cli.get_orders()\n    if not orders:\n        return \"今日无任何委托订单\"\n    text = \"【今日订单列表】\\n\"\n    for o in orders:\n        text += f\"ID:{o.id} | {o.action} {o.symbol} | 状态：{o.status} | 价格：{o.limit_price} | 数量：{o.quantity}\\n\"\n    return text\n\ndef get_open_orders():\n    \"\"\"查询未成交订单\"\"\"\n    orders = trade_cli.get_open_orders()\n    if not orders:\n        return \"当前无未成交订单\"\n    text = \"【未成交订单】\\n\"\n    for o in orders:\n        text += f\"ID:{o.id} | {o.action} {o.symbol} | 状态：{o.status} | 价格：{o.limit_price} | 数量：{o.quantity}\\n\"\n    return text\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":4100,"output":1837,"cacheRead":106560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112497,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779157898356}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5204ba3","parentId":"b5153294","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:32:03.551Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9b21c4566f024e6392fb360f","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 5492 bytes to /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779157923549}}
{"type":"message","id":"ff4585cf","parentId":"f5204ba3","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:32:12.897Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me update the SKILL.md with the correct information.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_07707c8b51724a339d9c42ad","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Tiger Broker (老虎证券) Skill - 新加坡区\n\n## 概述\n老虎证券 Python SDK，新加坡区专属，支持模拟/实盘自动切换。\n\n## 环境变量 (OpenClaw .env)\n\n| 变量 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `TIGER_ID` | 老虎开放平台 Tiger ID |\n| `TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY` | RSA 私钥 (PKCS#8 DER base64，无PEM头尾) |\n| `TIGER_MODE` | `simulation` (模拟) 或 `live` (实盘) |\n| `TIGER_SIMULATION_ACCOUNT` | 模拟账户 ID |\n| `TIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT` | 实盘账户 ID |\n\n## 区域配置 (固定)\n- Region: `Region.SG` (新加坡)\n- 模拟: `Env.SANDBOX_SG`\n- 实盘: `Env.PRODUCTION_SG`\n\n## 域名 (已验证)\n- 生产: `https://openapi.tigerfintech.com/gateway`\n- 模拟: `https://openapi-sandbox.tigerfintech.com/gateway`\n- ⚠️ `openapi-sgp.itigerup.com` 域名不存在，不要使用\n\n## API 函数\n\n| 函数 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `get_stock_brief(symbol)` | 获取股票行情摘要 (简要) |\n| `get_stock_quote(symbol)` | 获取股票详细报价 |\n| `get_account_info()` | 获取账户总资产/可用资金/购买力/盈亏 |\n| `get_positions()` | 查询全部持仓 |\n| `place_order_limit(symbol, price, quantity, action)` | 限价单下单 |\n| `place_order_market(symbol, quantity, action)` | 市价单下单 |\n| `cancel_order(order_id)` | 撤单 |\n| `get_today_orders()` | 查询今日所有订单 |\n| `get_open_orders()` | 查询未成交订单 |\n\n## 依赖\n- `tigeropen` (Python SDK v3.5.8+)\n- `pip install tigeropen`\n\n## 配置状态\n- [x] Tiger ID: 20159412\n- [x] Private Key: PKCS#8 DER 格式\n- [x] 模拟账户: 21409378833585169\n- [x] 实盘账户: 1406653\n- [x] 域名验证: openapi.tigerfintech.com ✅\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1852,"output":633,"cacheRead":110656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113141,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779157923553}}
