{"type":"message","id":"54275606","parentId":"f5212898","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:36:35.330Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f88871f60a4c3d12cc0876fc07\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 10:36 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f88871f60a4c3d12cc0876fc07]\nVAN: 现在能跑不能跑老虎端实时模拟了"}],"timestamp":1779158195327}}
{"type":"message","id":"58274233","parentId":"54275606","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:36:56.467Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking if we can run the Tiger simulation now. Let me test it with the corrected code - using the production domain (which works) to access the simulation account.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9eb1ff2e282c4df89edd4164","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nfrom tigeropen.common.consts import Language, Region, Env\nfrom tigeropen.tiger_open_config import TigerOpenClientConfig\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\nfrom tigeropen.trade.trade_client import TradeClient\n\nprivate_key = \"\"\n\n# 使用 Env.SANDBOX_SG（SDK会自动选择正确域名）\nconfig = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\nconfig.tiger_id = '20159412'\nconfig.account = '21409378833585169'\nconfig.private_key = private_key\nconfig.language = Language.zh_CN\nconfig.env = Env.SANDBOX_SG\nconfig.region = Region.SG\n\nprint(\"=\" * 50)\nprint(\"🐯 老虎证券 新加坡模拟盘 实时测试\")\nprint(\"=\" * 50)\n\n# 1. 测试账户\nprint(\"\\n📊 [1] 账户信息:\")\ntry:\n    trade_client = TradeClient(config)\n    assets = trade_client.get_assets()\n    if assets:\n        summary = assets[0].summary\n        print(f\"  ✅ 总资产(净值): ${summary.net_liquidation:,.2f}\")\n        print(f\"  ✅ 可用资金: ${summary.cash:,.2f}\")\n        print(f\"  ✅ 购买力: ${summary.buying_power:,.2f}\")\n        print(f\"  ✅ 已实现盈亏: ${summary.realized_pnl:,.2f}\")\n        print(f\"  ✅ 未实现盈亏: ${summary.unrealized_pnl:,.2f}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"  ❌ 未获取到账户信息\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ 错误: {e}\")\n\n# 2. 测试行情\nprint(\"\\n📈 [2] 行情测试:\")\ntry:\n    quote_client = QuoteClient(config)\n    symbols = ['AAPL', 'TSLA', 'NVDA']\n    for sym in symbols:\n        try:\n            res = quote_client.get_briefs([sym])\n            if res:\n                q = res[0]\n                print(f\"  ✅ {sym}: ${q.latest_price:.2f} ({q.change_percent:.2f}%)\")\n            else:\n                print(f\"  ⚠️ {sym}: 无数据\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"  ❌ {sym}: {str(e)[:80]}\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ 行情客户端错误: {e}\")\n\n# 3. 测试持仓\nprint(\"\\n💼 [3] 持仓查询:\")\ntry:\n    positions = trade_client.get_positions()\n    if positions:\n        for p in positions:\n            print(f\"  📌 {p.symbol}: {p.quantity}股 | 成本: ${p.cost_price:.2f} | 盈亏: ${p.unrealized_pnl:.2f}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"  ✅ 当前无持仓（空账户）\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ 错误: {e}\")\n\n# 4. 测试订单\nprint(\"\\n📋 [4] 订单查询:\")\ntry:\n    orders = trade_client.get_orders()\n    if orders:\n        for o in orders:\n            print(f\"  📌 ID:{o.id} | {o.action} {o.symbol} | {o.status}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"  ✅ 今日无订单\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ 错误: {e}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 50)\nprint(\"🏁 测试完成\")\nprint(\"=\" * 50)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":45580,"output":1503,"cacheRead":28672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75755,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779158195329}}
