{"type":"message","id":"9428d1d4","parentId":"a335e79d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:52:45.592Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HK market data works! The attribute is just not `change_percent` - there's no direct percentage change attribute in `QuoteBrief`. I need to calculate it from `latest_price` and `prev_close`. Let me test more.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2b6b775e6a234ce68e331ecd","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nfrom tigeropen.common.consts import Language\nfrom tigeropen.tiger_open_config import TigerOpenClientConfig\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\n\nprivate_key = \"\"\n\nconfig = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\nconfig.tiger_id = '20159412'\nconfig.account = '21409378833585169'\nconfig.private_key = private_key\nconfig.language = Language.zh_CN\n\nqc = QuoteClient(config)\n\nprint(\"=\" * 50)\nprint(\"🐯 老虎证券行情测试 (港股/A股)\")\nprint(\"=\" * 50)\n\n# 港股\nprint(\"\\n🇭🇰 港股行情:\")\nhk_symbols = ['00700', '09988', '03690', '01810']\nfor sym in hk_symbols:\n    try:\n        res = qc.get_briefs([sym])\n        if res:\n            q = res[0]\n            price = q.latest_price\n            prev = q.prev_close\n            change = price - prev if price and prev else 0\n            pct = (change / prev * 100) if prev and prev > 0 else 0\n            print(f\"  ✅ {sym} ({q.name}): HK${price:.2f} ({pct:+.2f}%)\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"  ⚠️ {sym}: 无数据\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"  ❌ {sym}: {str(e)[:80]}\")\n\n# A股\nprint(\"\\n🇨🇳 A股行情:\")\na_symbols = ['600519', '000858', '601398']\nfor sym in a_symbols:\n    try:\n        res = qc.get_briefs([sym])\n        if res:\n            q = res[0]\n            price = q.latest_price\n            prev = q.prev_close\n            change = price - prev if price and prev else 0\n            pct = (change / prev * 100) if prev and prev > 0 else 0\n            print(f\"  ✅ {sym} ({q.name}): ¥{price:.2f} ({pct:+.2f}%)\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"  ⚠️ {sym}: 无数据\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"  ❌ {sym}: {str(e)[:80]}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 50)\nprint(\"✅ 港股/A股行情可用！美股需开通权限\")\nprint(\"=\" * 50)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1108,"output":1295,"cacheRead":90880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93283,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779159148816}}
{"type":"message","id":"072b1249","parentId":"9428d1d4","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:52:46.905Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2b6b775e6a234ce68e331ecd","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"==================================================\n🐯 老虎证券行情测试 (港股/A股)\n==================================================\n\n🇭🇰 港股行情:\n  ✅ 00700 (腾讯控股): HK$464.80 (+3.47%)\n  ✅ 09988 (阿里巴巴-W): HK$134.40 (+2.05%)\n  ✅ 03690 (美团-W): HK$82.60 (+0.55%)\n  ✅ 01810 (小米集团-W): HK$30.62 (-0.13%)\n\n🇨🇳 A股行情:\n  ✅ 600519 (贵州茅台): ¥1323.26 (+0.02%)\n  ✅ 000858 (五 粮 液): ¥86.19 (+0.72%)\n  ✅ 601398 (工商银行): ¥7.27 (+1.11%)\n\n==================================================\n✅ 港股/A股行情可用！美股需开通权限\n=================================================="}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1307,"aggregated":"==================================================\n🐯 老虎证券行情测试 (港股/A股)\n==================================================\n\n🇭🇰 港股行情:\n  ✅ 00700 (腾讯控股): HK$464.80 (+3.47%)\n  ✅ 09988 (阿里巴巴-W): HK$134.40 (+2.05%)\n  ✅ 03690 (美团-W): HK$82.60 (+0.55%)\n  ✅ 01810 (小米集团-W): HK$30.62 (-0.13%)\n\n🇨🇳 A股行情:\n  ✅ 600519 (贵州茅台): ¥1323.26 (+0.02%)\n  ✅ 000858 (五 粮 液): ¥86.19 (+0.72%)\n  ✅ 601398 (工商银行): ¥7.27 (+1.11%)\n\n==================================================\n✅ 港股/A股行情可用！美股需开通权限\n==================================================","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779159166902}}
{"type":"message","id":"1e8a5c6f","parentId":"072b1249","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:52:52.579Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! The Tiger API works perfectly for HK and A-share markets! The issue is only with US market data permissions. Let me summarize the findings for VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"🎉 **老虎行情已跑通！港股/A股实时行情正常！**\n\n| 市场 | 状态 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 🇭🇰 港股 | ✅ | 腾讯 HK$464.80 (+3.47%) |\n| 🇨🇳 A股 | ✅ | 茅台 ¥1323.26 (+0.02%) |\n| 🇺🇸 美股 | ❌ | 需在老虎开放平台开通权限 |\n\n**结论：**\n- 你的 Tiger 账户**港股/A股行情免费可用**\n- **美股行情需要单独开通权限**（可能需要在老虎开放平台申请）\n- 交易功能（模拟盘）完全正常\n\n**推荐架构：**\n- 港股/A股行情 → Tiger（实时，免费）\n- 美股行情 → Finnhub（免费，5个Key轮换）\n- 交易 → Tiger 模拟盘\n\nVAN，要去老虎开放平台开通美股行情权限吗？还是先用 Finnhub 做美股行情？ 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1522,"output":310,"cacheRead":91968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93800,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779159166907}}
{"type":"message","id":"64e6a8b6","parentId":"1e8a5c6f","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:52:55.971Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f894d5ff8b4c4453b244850cbf\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 10:52 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f894d5ff8b4c4453b244850cbf]\nVAN: import os\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\nfrom tigeropen.trade.trade_client import TradeClient\nfrom tigeropen.common.consts import Region, Env\n\n# ===================== 行情端：实盘拿行情 =====================\nQUOTE_TIGER_ID = os.getenv(\"TIGER_QUOTE_ID\")\nQUOTE_PRIVATE_KEY = os.getenv(\"TIGER_QUOTE_KEY\")\nQUOTE_HOST = os.getenv(\"TIGER_QUOTE_HOST\")\nQUOTE_ENV = Env.PRODUCTION_SG\n\nquote_client = QuoteClient(\n    tiger_id=QUOTE_TIGER_ID,\n    private_key=QUOTE_PRIVATE_KEY,\n    env=QUOTE_ENV,\n    region=Region.SG,\n    host=QUOTE_HOST\n)\n\n# ===================== 交易端：沙箱模拟交易 =====================\nTRADE_TIGER_ID = os.getenv(\"TIGER_TRADE_ID\")\nTRADE_ACCOUNT = os.getenv(\"TIGER_TRADE_ACCOUNT\")\nTRADE_PRIVATE_KEY = os.getenv(\"TIGER_TRADE_KEY\")\nTRADE_HOST = os.getenv(\"TIGER_TRADE_HOST\")\nTRADE_ENV = Env.SANDBOX_SG\n\ntrade_client = TradeClient(\n    tiger_id=TRADE_TIGER_ID,\n    account=TRADE_ACCOUNT,\n    private_key=TRADE_PRIVATE_KEY,\n    env=TRADE_ENV,\n    region=Region.SG,\n    host=TRADE_HOST\n)\n\nprint(\"✅ 行情端【实盘】初始化完成 | 交易端【模拟盘】初始化完成\")\n\n# ===================== 业务函数 =====================\n# 行情（实盘拉取，正常可用）\ndef get_stock_quote(symbol:str):\n    res = quote_client.get_stock_quote([symbol])\n    if not res:\n        return \"暂无行情数据\"\n    d = res[0]\n    return f\"{symbol} 现价:{d.latest_price} 涨跌:{d.change} 涨幅:{d.change_percent:.2f}%\"\n\n# 账户/持仓/订单/下单 全部走模拟盘\ndef get_full_account_info():\n    acc = trade_client.get_account()\n    return f\"模拟账户总资产:{acc.liquidation_value} 可用资金:{acc.cash_available}\"\n\ndef get_all_positions():\n    pos = trade_client.get_positions()\n    if not pos:\n        return \"模拟盘暂无持仓\"\n    txt = \"\"\n    for p in pos:\n        txt += f\"{p.symbol} 持仓{p.quantity} 盈亏{p.unrealized_pnl}\\n\"\n    return txt\n\ndef place_order_limit(symbol:str,price:float,num:int,action=\"BUY\"):\n    try:\n        oid = trade_client.place_order(symbol=symbol,price=price,quantity=num,action=action,order_type=\"LMT\")\n        return f\"模拟盘委托成功 订单号:{oid}\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"委托失败:{str(e)}\"\n\ndef place_order_market(symbol:str,num:int,action=\"BUY\"):\n    try:\n        oid = trade_client.place_order(symbol=symbol,quantity=num,action=action,order_type=\"MKT\")\n        return f\"模拟盘市价委托成功 订单号:{oid}\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"委托失败:{str(e)}\"\n\ndef get_open_orders():\n    orders = trade_client.get_open_orders()\n    if not orders:\n        return \"模拟盘无未成交订单\"\n    return \"\\n\".join([f\"{o.order_id} {o.action} {o.symbol} {o.status}\" for o in orders])\n\ndef cancel_order(oid:str):\n    try:\n        trade_client.cancel_order(oid)\n        return f\"模拟盘撤单成功:{oid}\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"撤单失败:{str(e)}\""}],"timestamp":1779159175968}}
{"type":"message","id":"eeca702a","parentId":"64e6a8b6","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:53:02.309Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is providing a cleaner version of the Tiger client code that separates quote (live) from trade (simulation). But this code still uses `Region` and `Env` which we found don't exist in the SDK. Also, it uses `host` parameter which might not be supported.\n\nLet me check if the SDK supports `host` parameter and `Region`/`Env` enums, and if not, create a corrected version.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1554b76b66234d27b5878eb0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\nfrom tigeropen.trade.trade_client import TradeClient\nimport inspect\n\n# 检查 QuoteClient 初始化参数\nsig = inspect.signature(QuoteClient.__init__)\nprint('QuoteClient 参数:', list(sig.parameters.keys()))\n\nsig2 = inspect.signature(TradeClient.__init__)\nprint('TradeClient 参数:', list(sig2.parameters.keys()))\n\n# 检查 Region/Env\ntry:\n    from tigeropen.common.consts import Region\n    print('Region 可用:', [r for r in dir(Region) if not r.startswith('_')])\nexcept ImportError:\n    print('Region 不可用')\n\ntry:\n    from tigeropen.common.consts import Env\n    print('Env 可用:', [e for e in dir(Env) if not e.startswith('_')])\nexcept ImportError:\n    print('Env 不可用')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1382,"output":396,"cacheRead":93440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95218,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779159175970}}
{"type":"message","id":"68373ba3","parentId":"eeca702a","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:53:02.751Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1554b76b66234d27b5878eb0","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"QuoteClient 参数: ['self', 'client_config', 'logger', 'is_grab_permission']\nTradeClient 参数: ['self', 'client_config', 'logger']\nRegion 不可用\nEnv 不可用"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":436,"aggregated":"QuoteClient 参数: ['self', 'client_config', 'logger', 'is_grab_permission']\nTradeClient 参数: ['self', 'client_config', 'logger']\nRegion 不可用\nEnv 不可用","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779159182749}}
{"type":"message","id":"0d15efa1","parentId":"68373ba3","timestamp":"2026-05-19T02:53:34.264Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed - `Region`, `Env`, and `host` parameters don't exist in the SDK. The clients only accept `client_config`. Let me create a corrected version that separates quote and trade but uses the correct API.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"VAN，你这个架构思路很好 — 行情/交易分离。但 SDK 不支持 `Region`、`Env`、`host` 这些参数。让我写个修正版："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b5e08c4bb5b74f42ad524acc","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"import os\nfrom tigeropen.common.consts import Language\nfrom tigeropen.tiger_open_config import TigerOpenClientConfig\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\nfrom tigeropen.trade.trade_client import TradeClient\n\n# ===================== 环境变量 =====================\nTIGER_ID = os.getenv(\"TIGER_ID\", \"20159412\")\nTIGER_PRIVATE_KEY = os.getenv(\"TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\")\nTIGER_MODE = os.getenv(\"TIGER_MODE\", \"simulation\")\nTIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT = os.getenv(\"TIGER_SIMULATION_ACCOUNT\", \"21409378833585169\")\nTIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT = os.getenv(\"TIGER_LIVE_ACCOUNT\", \"1406653\")\n\n# ===================== 域名配置 =====================\n# 生产: openapi.tigerfintech.com (默认)\n# 模拟: openapi-sandbox.tigerfintech.com (默认)\n# ⚠️ openapi-sgp.itigerup.com / openapi-sg.tigerbrokers.com 均不存在\n\n# ===================== 行情端：生产域名拿行情 =====================\nquote_config = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\nquote_config.tiger_id = TIGER_ID\nquote_config.private_key = TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\nquote_config.language = Language.zh_CN\n\n# ===================== 交易端：模拟盘 =====================\ntrade_config = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\ntrade_config.tiger_id = TIGER_ID\ntrade_config.account = TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT\ntrade_config.private_key = TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\ntrade_config.language = Language.zh_CN\n\n# 初始化客户端\nquote_client = QuoteClient(quote_config)\ntrade_client = TradeClient(trade_config)\n\nprint(\"✅ 行情端【生产】+ 交易端【模拟盘】初始化完成\")\n\n# ===================== 行情函数（港股/A股可用，美股需开通权限） =====================\ndef get_stock_brief(symbol: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    获取股票行情摘要\n    :param symbol: 股票代码 (如 AAPL / 00700 / 600519)\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        res = quote_client.get_briefs([symbol])\n        if not res:\n            return f\"【失败】未获取到 {symbol} 行情数据\"\n        d = res[0]\n        price = d.latest_price\n        prev = d.prev_close\n        change = price - prev if price and prev else 0\n        pct = (change / prev * 100) if prev and prev > 0 else 0\n        return (\n            f\"【{symbol} 实时行情】\\n\"\n            f\"名称：{d.name}\\n\"\n            f\"最新价：{price}\\n\"\n            f\"涨跌：{change:+.2f} ({pct:+.2f}%)\\n\"\n            f\"开盘价：{d.open_price}\\n\"\n            f\"最高价：{d.high_price}\\n\"\n            f\"最低价：{d.low_price}\\n\"\n            f\"昨收：{prev}\"\n        )\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【错误】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef get_stock_quote(symbol: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    获取股票详细报价\n    :param symbol: 股票代码\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        res = quote_client.get_stock_quote([symbol])\n        if not res:\n            return f\"【失败】未获取到 {symbol} 行情数据\"\n        d = res[0]\n        return (\n            f\"【{symbol} 详细报价】\\n\"\n            f\"最新价：{d.latest_price}\\n\"\n            f\"涨跌：{d.change}\\n\"\n            f\"涨跌幅：{d.change_percent:.2f}%\\n\"\n            f\"开盘价：{d.open}\\n\"\n            f\"最高价：{d.high}\\n\"\n            f\"最低价：{d.low}\\n\"\n            f\"成交量：{d.volume}\\n\"\n            f\"成交额：{d.amount}\"\n        )\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【错误】{str(e)}\"\n\n# ===================== 交易函数（模拟盘） =====================\ndef get_account_info():\n    \"\"\"获取模拟账户信息\"\"\"\n    try:\n        assets = trade_client.get_assets()\n        if not assets:\n            return \"【失败】未获取到账户信息\"\n        s = assets[0].summary\n        return (\n            f\"【模拟盘账户信息】\\n\"\n            f\"总资产(净值)：${s.net_liquidation:,.2f}\\n\"\n            f\"可用资金：${s.cash:,.2f}\\n\"\n            f\"购买力：${s.buying_power:,.2f}\\n\"\n            f\"持仓市值：${s.gross_position_value:,.2f}\\n\"\n            f\"已实现盈亏：${s.realized_pnl:,.2f}\\n\"\n            f\"未实现盈亏：${s.unrealized_pnl:,.2f}\"\n        )\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【错误】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef get_positions():\n    \"\"\"查询模拟盘持仓\"\"\"\n    try:\n        pos_list = trade_client.get_positions()\n        if not pos_list:\n            return \"模拟盘暂无持仓\"\n        text = \"【模拟盘持仓】\\n\"\n        for p in pos_list:\n            text += f\"{p.symbol} | 数量：{p.quantity} | 成本价：{p.cost_price} | 盈亏：{p.unrealized_pnl}\\n\"\n        return text\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【错误】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef place_order_limit(symbol: str, price: float, quantity: int, action: str = \"BUY\"):\n    \"\"\"\n    限价单\n    :param symbol: 标的代码\n    :param price: 限价价格\n    :param quantity: 股数\n    :param action: BUY / SELL\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        order = trade_client.create_order(\n            account=trade_client.account,\n            symbol=symbol,\n            action=action,\n            order_type=\"LMT\",\n            quantity=quantity,\n            limit_price=price\n        )\n        trade_client.place_order(order)\n        return f\"【模拟盘下单成功】订单ID：{order.id} | {action} {symbol} 限价{price} 数量{quantity}股\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【下单失败】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef place_order_market(symbol: str, quantity: int, action: str = \"BUY\"):\n    \"\"\"\n    市价单\n    :param symbol: 标的代码\n    :param quantity: 股数\n    :param action: BUY / SELL\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        order = trade_client.create_order(\n            account=trade_client.account,\n            symbol=symbol,\n            action=action,\n            order_type=\"MKT\",\n            quantity=quantity\n        )\n        trade_client.place_order(order)\n        return f\"【模拟盘市价下单成功】订单ID：{order.id} | {action} {symbol} 数量{quantity}股\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【下单失败】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef get_open_orders():\n    \"\"\"查询未成交订单\"\"\"\n    try:\n        orders = trade_client.get_open_orders()\n        if not orders:\n            return \"模拟盘无未成交订单\"\n        text = \"【未成交订单】\\n\"\n        for o in orders:\n            text += f\"ID:{o.id} | {o.action} {o.symbol} | {o.status} | 价格：{o.limit_price} | 数量：{o.quantity}\\n\"\n        return text\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【错误】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef cancel_order(order_id: str):\n    \"\"\"撤单\"\"\"\n    try:\n        trade_client.cancel_order(order_id)\n        return f\"【模拟盘撤单成功】订单{order_id}已撤销\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【撤单失败】{str(e)}\"\n\ndef get_today_orders():\n    \"\"\"查询今日所有订单\"\"\"\n    try:\n        orders = trade_client.get_orders()\n        if not orders:\n            return \"今日无任何委托订单\"\n        text = \"【今日订单】\\n\"\n        for o in orders:\n            text += f\"ID:{o.id} | {o.action} {o.symbol} | {o.status} | 价格：{o.limit_price} | 数量：{o.quantity}\\n\"\n        return text\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"【错误】{str(e)}\"\n\n# ===================== 快速测试 =====================\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 50)\n    print(\"🐯 老虎证券 行情/交易 分离架构测试\")\n    print(\"=\" * 50)\n\n    # 行情测试\n    print(\"\\n📈 [1] 港股行情:\")\n    for sym in ['00700', '09988']:\n        print(f\"  {get_stock_brief(sym)}\")\n\n    print(\"\\n🇨🇳 [2] A股行情:\")\n    for sym in ['600519', '000858']:\n        print(f\"  {get_stock_brief(sym)}\")\n\n    # 交易测试\n    print(\"\\n📊 [3] 模拟账户:\")\n    print(f\"  {get_account_info()}\")\n\n    print(\"\\n💼 [4] 持仓:\")\n    print(f\"  {get_positions()}\")\n\n    print(\"\\n📋 [5] 订单:\")\n    print(f\"  {get_today_orders()}\")\n\n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 50)\n    print(\"🏁 测试完成\")\n    print(\"=\" * 50)\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":398,"output":2320,"cacheRead":94784,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97502,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779159182753}}
