 [ref=e553]:\n              - listitem [ref=e554]:\n                - link \"Contact Us\" [ref=e555] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /docs/contact\n                  - generic [ref=e557]: Contact Us\n          - generic [ref=e558]:\n            - text: Powered by\n            - link \"ReadMe\" [ref=e559] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: https://readme.com?ref_src=hub&project=openapi-doc-wdrp\n              - img [ref=e560]\n        - button \"Hide sidebar navigation\" [ref=e562] [cursor=pointer]\n      - article [ref=e563]:\n        - heading \"Trading and Data Fees\" [level=1] [ref=e567]\n        - generic [ref=e568]:\n          - generic [ref=e569]:\n            - generic [ref=e570]:\n              - heading \"Trading Fees Skip link to Trading Fees\" [level=2] [ref=e571]:\n                - generic [ref=e573]: Trading Fees\n                - link \"Skip link to Trading Fees\" [ref=e574] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#trading-fees\"\n                  - text: \n              - paragraph [ref=e575]:\n                - text: There are\n                - strong [ref=e576]: no additional charges\n                - text: for trading via OpenAPI; trading fees are consistent with those incurred through the APP. For specific fee standards, please refer to the\n                - link \"official fee description\" [ref=e577] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /docs/contact#commission_link\n                - text: .\n              - heading \"Market Data Fees Skip link to Market Data Fees\" [level=2] [ref=e578]:\n                - generic [ref=e580]: Market Data Fees\n                - link \"Skip link to Market Data Fees\" [ref=e581] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#market-data-fees\"\n                  - text: \n              - paragraph [ref=e582]:\n                - text: OpenAPI's market data permissions are\n                - strong [ref=e583]: independent of PC/APP\n                - text: and must be purchased separately.\n              - paragraph [ref=e584]: They will not conflict with PC/APP market data permissions.\n              - paragraph [ref=e585]:\n                - text: The market data provided by OpenAPI offers\n                - strong [ref=e586]: lower latency and faster updates\n                - text: .\n              - blockquote [ref=e587]:\n                - generic [ref=e588]: ⚠️\n                - paragraph [ref=e589]:\n                  - strong [ref=e590]: CAUTION\n                - paragraph [ref=e591]:\n                  - text: If you are simultaneously calling the API to obtain market data on multiple devices, please refer to the\n                  - link \"grab_quote_permission\" [ref=e592] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /docs/quote-common#grab_quote_permission\n                  - text: interface description for handling.\n              - heading \"Purchasing Market Data Skip link to Purchasing Market Data\" [level=2] [ref=e593]:\n                - generic [ref=e595]: Purchasing Market Data\n                - link \"Skip link to Purchasing Market Data\" [ref=e596] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#purchasing-market-data\"\n                  - text: \n              - paragraph [ref=e597]:\n                - strong [ref=e598]: Retail clients\n                - text: \"have two ways to purchase market data permissions:\"\n              - list [ref=e599]:\n                - listitem [ref=e600]:\n                  - text: Purchase on the\n                  - link \"developer information page\" [ref=e601] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://developer.itigerup.com/profile\n                  - text: ;\n                - listitem [ref=e602]: \"Purchase in the APP, path: Tiger Trade APP - My - Market Data Permissions Store - API.\"\n              - paragraph [ref=e603]:\n                - strong [ref=e604]: Institutional clients\n                - text: can purchase at the\n                - link \"Institutional Center\" [ref=e605] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /docs/contact#institution_link\n                - text: \", path: User Management - Market Data - API Market Data.\"\n              - heading \"Permission Inquiry Skip link to Permission Inquiry\" [level=2] [ref=e606]:\n                - generic [ref=e608]: Permission Inquiry\n                - link \"Skip link to Permission Inquiry\" [ref=e609] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#permission-inquiry\"\n                  - text: \n              - paragraph [ref=e610]:\n                - text: Query purchased market data permissions via API\n                - link \"Query Market Data Permissions get_quote_permission\" [ref=e611] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /docs/quote-common#get_quote_permission\n            - paragraph [ref=e614]:\n              - generic [ref=e615]: \n              - text: Updated 7 months ago\n            - separator [ref=e616]\n            - navigation \"Pagination Controls\" [ref=e617]:\n              - 'link \"Previous Page: Order and Trading Rules\" [ref=e618] [cursor=pointer]':\n                - /url: /docs/trade-rules\n                - generic [ref=e619]: \n                - generic [ref=e620]: Order and Trading Rules\n              - 'link \"Next Page: Data Permissions and Limitations\" [ref=e621] [cursor=pointer]':\n                - /url: /docs/permission\n                - generic [ref=e622]: Data Permissions and Limitations\n                - generic [ref=e623]: \n          - generic [ref=e627]:\n            - button \"Copy Page\" [ref=e628] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e631]: Copy Page\n            - button [ref=e632] [cursor=pointer]\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"25067080dd451e9f\">>>"}],"details":{"ok":true,"format":"ai","targetId":"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33","url":"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/fee","refs":476,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"browser","kind":"snapshot