{"type":"message","id":"b202b0a5","parentId":"cf858dbc","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:26:31.624Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2bd9a1e926b34b9097e9565b","toolName":"browser","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/ratelimit\"\n}"}],"details":{"ok":true,"targetId":"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33","url":"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/ratelimit"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779161191622}}
{"type":"message","id":"6f0d67f4","parentId":"b202b0a5","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:26:34.931Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me get the rate limits content.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_27323f9e79734867a3490ce9","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"act","targetId":"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33","kind":"evaluate","fn":"() => { const article = document.querySelector('article'); if (article) { const headings = article.querySelectorAll('h1, h2, h3'); const paragraphs = article.querySelectorAll('p, li, code, pre, td, th'); let text = []; headings.forEach(h => text.push('## ' + h.textContent.trim())); paragraphs.forEach(p => { const t = p.textContent.trim(); if (t.length > 3) text.push(t); }); return text.join('\\n').substring(0, 6000); } return 'No article found'; }"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":186,"output":207,"cacheRead":67008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67401,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779161191625}}
{"type":"message","id":"c7118035","parentId":"6f0d67f4","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:26:34.974Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_27323f9e79734867a3490ce9","toolName":"browser","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/ratelimit\",\n  \"result\": \"## Rate Limits\\n## Rate Limiting Rules\\n## High-Frequency Interface List (120 times/minute)\\n## Medium-Frequency Interface List (60 times/minute)\\n## Low-Frequency Interface List (10 times/minute)\\nTo protect the server and prevent malicious attacks, all interfaces that need to send requests to the Tiger Brokers OpenAPI server have frequency limitations.\\nRate limits are applied at the tigerId + method level, meaning each tigerId has an independent quota for each API method. For example, calls to place_order and get_orders under the same tigerId are counted separately and do not affect each other.\\nplace_order\\nget_orders\\nAPI methods are classified into three tiers based on allowed call frequency:\\nTier\\nRate Limit\\nCounting Method\\nHigh-frequency\\n120 calls/min\\nPer tigerId + method, 60-second rolling window\\nMedium-frequency\\n60 calls/min\\nPer tigerId + method, 60-second rolling window\\nLow-frequency\\n10 calls/min\\nPer tigerId + method, 60-second rolling window\\nThe error message triggered by rate limiting is as follows:\\ncode=4 msg=rate limit error(current limiting interface:<interface_name>, up to 60 times per minute)\\ncode=4 msg=rate limit error(current limiting interface:<interface_name>, up to 60 times per minute)\\nCAUTION\\nIf the interface request frequency is too high and continues to make requests persistently, the account may be automatically added to the blacklist by the system. Accounts added to the blacklist will not be able to continue making interface calls.\\nIf you have high-frequency interface call requirements, you can communicate with us separately here\\nInterface Method\\nGet Order ID (create_order)\\nPlace Order (place_order)\\nModify Order (modify_order)\\nCancel Order (cancel_order)\\nGet Orders (get_orders/get_order)\\nGet Open Orders (get_open_orders)\\nGet Cancelled Orders (get_cancelled_orders)\\nGet Filled Orders (get_filled_orders)\\nGet Timeline (get_timeline)\\nGet Real-time Quotes (get_stock_briefs)\\nGet Trade Ticks (get_trade_ticks)\\nGet Option Briefs (get_option_briefs)\\nGet Option Trade Ticks (get_option_trade_ticks)\\nGet Future Real-time Quotes (get_future_briefs)\\nInterface Method\\nGet Option Chain (get_option_chain)\\nGet Option Expirations (get_option_expirations)\\nGet Depth Quotes (get_depth_quote)\\nGet Single Contract (get_contract)\\nGet Batch Contracts (get_contracts)\\nGet Derivative Contracts (get_derivative_contracts)\\nGet Shortable Stocks List (quote_shortable_stocks)\\nGet Stock Trading Information (get_trade_metas)\\nGet Future Trading Times (get_future_trading_times)\\nGet Current Future Contract (get_current_future_contract)\\nGet Managed Accounts (get_managed_accounts)\\nGet Global Account Assets (get_assets)\\nGet Prime/Paper Trading Account Assets (get_prime_assets)\\nGet Positions (get_positions)\\nGet Transaction Reports (get_transactions)\\nGet Historical Timeline Data (get_timeline_history)\\nGet Stock K-Line (get_bars)\\nGet Option K-Line (get_option_bars)\\nGet Future K-Line (get_future_bars)\\nInterface Method\\nGrab Quote Permission (grab_quote_permission)\\nGet Quote Permission List (get_quote_permission)\\nGet Market Status (get_market_status)\\nGet Stock Symbols (get_symbols)\\nGet Stock Symbol Names (get_symbol_names)\\nGet Stock Details (get_stock_details)\\nGet Future Exchanges (get_future_exchanges)\\nGet Trading Rank (get_trade_rank)\\nUpdated 2 months ago\\nRate Limiting Rules\\nHigh-Frequency Interface List (120 times/minute)\\nMedium-Frequency Interface List (60 times/minute)\\nLow-Frequency Interface List (10 times/minute)\\nRate Limiting Rules\\nHigh-Frequency Interface List (120 times/minute)\\nMedium-Frequency Interface List (60 times/minute)\\nLow-Frequency Interface List (10 times/minute)\"\n}"}],"details":{"ok":true,"targetId":"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33","url":"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/ratelimit","result":"## Rate Limits\n## Rate Limiting Rules\n## High-Frequency Interface List (120 times/minute)\n## Medium-Frequency Interface List (60 times/minute)\n## Low-Frequency Interface List (10 times/minute)\nTo protect the server and prevent malicious attacks, all interfaces that need to send requests to the Tiger Brokers OpenAPI server have frequency limitations.\nRate limits are applied at the tigerId + method level, meaning each tigerId has an independent quota for each API method. For example, calls to place_order and get_orders under the same tigerId are counted separately and do not affect each other.\nplace_order\nget_orders\nAPI methods are classified into three tiers based on allowed call frequency:\nTier\nRate Limit\nCounting Method\nHigh-frequency\n120 calls/min\nPer tigerId + method, 60-second rolling window\nMedium-frequency\n60 calls/min\nPer tigerId + method, 60-second rolling window\nLow-frequency\n10 calls/min\nPer tigerId + method, 60-second rolling window\nThe error message triggered by rate limiting is as follows:\ncode=4 msg=rate limit error(current limiting interface:<interface_name>, up to 60 times per minute)\ncode=4 msg=rate limit error(current limiting interface:<interface_name>, up to 60 times per minute)\nCAUTION\nIf the interface request frequency is too high and continues to make requests persistently, the account may be automatically added to the blacklist by the system. Accounts added to the blacklist will not be able to continue making interface calls.\nIf you have high-frequency interface call requirements, you can communicate with us separately here\nInterface Method\nGet Order ID (create_order)\nPlace Order (place_order)\nModify Order (modify_order)\nCancel Order (cancel_order)\nGet Orders (get_orders/get_order)\nGet Open Orders (get_open_orders)\nGet Cancelled Orders (get_cancelled_orders)\nGet Filled Orders (get_filled_orders)\nGet Timeline (get_timeline)\nGet Real-time Quotes (get_stock_briefs)\nGet Trade Ticks (get_trade_ticks)\nGet Option Briefs (get_option_briefs)\nGet Option Trade Ticks (get_option_trade_ticks)\nGet Future Real-time Quotes (get_future_briefs)\nInterface Method\nGet Option Chain (get_option_chain)\nGet Option Expirations (get_option_expirations)\nGet Depth Quotes (get_depth_quote)\nGet Single Contract (get_contract)\nGet Batch Contracts (get_contracts)\nGet Derivative Contracts (get_derivative_contracts)\nGet Shortable Stocks List (quote_shortable_stocks)\nGet Stock Trading Information (get_trade_metas)\nGet Future Trading Times (get_future_trading_times)\nGet Current Future Contract (get_current_future_contract)\nGet Managed Accounts (get_managed_accounts)\nGet Global Account Assets (get_assets)\nGet Prime/Paper Trading Account Assets (get_prime_assets)\nGet Positions (get_positions)\nGet Transaction Reports (get_transactions)\nGet Historical Timeline Data (get_timeline_history)\nGet Stock K-Line (get_bars)\nGet Option K-Line (get_option_bars)\nGet Future K-Line (get_future_bars)\nInterface Method\nGrab Quote Permission (grab_quote_permission)\nGet Quote Permission List (get_quote_permission)\nGet Market Status (get_market_status)\nGet Stock Symbols (get_symbols)\nGet Stock Symbol Names (get_symbol_names)\nGet Stock Details (get_stock_details)\nGet Future Exchanges (get_future_exchanges)\nGet Trading Rank (get_trade_rank)\nUpdated 2 months ago\nRate Limiting Rules\nHigh-Frequency Interface List (120 times/minute)\nMedium-Frequency Interface List (60 times/minute)\nLow-Frequency Interface List (10 times/minute)\nRate Limiting Rules\nHigh-Frequency Interface List (120 times/minute)\nMedium-Frequency Interface List (60 times/minute)\nLow-Frequency Interface List (10 times/minute)"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779161194972}}
