{"type":"message","id":"c7179027","parentId":"22d31763","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:04:55.099Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d94f1fb095af4bdfabac71b0","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ CLI-Anything skill installed\n---\nname: cli-hub-meta-skill\ndescription: >-\n  Discover agent-native CLIs for professional software. Access the live catalog\n  to find tools for creative workflows, productivity, AI, and more.\n---\n\n# CLI-Hub Meta-Skill\n\nCLI-Hub is a marketplace of agent-native command-line interfaces that make professional software accessible to AI agents.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install the CLI Hub package manager\npip install cli-anything-hub\n\n# Browse all available CLIs\ncli-hub list\n\n# Search by category or keyword\ncli-hub search image\ncli-hub search \"3d modeling\"\n\n# Install a CLI\ncli-hub install gimp\n\n# Show details for a CLI\ncli-hub info gimp\n```"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":11,"aggregated":"✅ CLI-Anything skill installed\n---\nname: cli-hub-meta-skill\ndescription: >-\n  Discover agent-native CLIs for professional software. Access the live catalog\n  to find tools for creative workflows, productivity, AI, and more.\n---\n\n# CLI-Hub Meta-Skill\n\nCLI-Hub is a marketplace of agent-native command-line interfaces that make professional software accessible to AI agents.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install the CLI Hub package manager\npip install cli-anything-hub\n\n# Browse all available CLIs\ncli-hub list\n\n# Search by category or keyword\ncli-hub search image\ncli-hub search \"3d modeling\"\n\n# Install a CLI\ncli-hub install gimp\n\n# Show details for a CLI\ncli-hub info gimp\n```","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779177895097}}
