{"type":"message","id":"8a05b1af","parentId":"1577e4cc","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:26:49.682Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN shared a Tiger API test script that uses `Region`, `Env` from `tigeropen.common.consts`. We already know that these don't exist in the installed SDK (v3.5.8). But VAN's code suggests a different approach — perhaps from an older or different version. Let me adapt the test using what we know works, but test specifically with the production host `openapi-sg.tigerbrokers.com`.\n\nWait — previously we discovered that `openapi-sg.tigerbrokers.com` was NXDOMAIN. Let me re-check this, because VAN's code specifically mentions it. Maybe something changed, or VAN has different network access.\n\nAlso, VAN's code reads from .env file. Let me test using our known-working config pattern but with the specific host that VAN mentions.\n\nKey question: Can we get free L1 US stock quotes via Tiger's Singapore production API? Previously we got \"permission denied\" for US market. But VAN's code claims the L1 basic quotes might be free.\n\nLet me test with `get_stock_briefs` (the correct SDK method) and see what happens.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"VAN 发了一个测试脚本，但 `Region`/`Env` 在 SDK v3.5.8 中不存在。不过核心问题很好 — 试试新加坡生产域名能不能拿免费美股 L1 行情："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ae391e03e1324c6e98c340a5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\nfrom tigeropen.tiger_open_config import TigerOpenClientConfig\nfrom tigeropen.common.consts import Language\n\nTIGER_ID = \"20159412\"\nTIGER_PRIVATE_KEY = \"\"\n\nprint(\"=\"*60)\nprint(\"🐯 美股行情测试 - 用不同域名/账户组合\")\nprint(\"=\"*60)\n\n# 组合1: 生产域名 + 模拟账户 (已知港股OK)\nprint(\"\\n[1] 生产域名 + 模拟账户:\")\nconfig1 = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\nconfig1.tiger_id = TIGER_ID\nconfig1.private_key = TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\nconfig1.language = Language.zh_CN\nconfig1.account = \"21409378833585169\"\ntry:\n    q1 = QuoteClient(config1)\n    briefs = q1.get_stock_briefs([\"AAPL\", \"TSLA\"])\n    if briefs is not None and len(briefs) > 0:\n        for b in briefs:\n            print(f\"  ✅ AAPL: {b}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"  ❌ 返回空\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ {str(e)[:150]}\")\n\n# 组合2: 生产域名 + 实盘账户\nprint(\"\\n[2] 生产域名 + 实盘账户:\")\nconfig2 = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\nconfig2.tiger_id = TIGER_ID\nconfig2.private_key = TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\nconfig2.language = Language.zh_CN\nconfig2.account = \"1406653\"\ntry:\n    q2 = QuoteClient(config2)\n    briefs = q2.get_stock_briefs([\"AAPL\", \"TSLA\"])\n    if briefs is not None and len(briefs) > 0:\n        for b in briefs:\n            print(f\"  ✅ {b}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"  ❌ 返回空\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ {str(e)[:150]}\")\n\n# 组合3: 港股对比（应该能用）\nprint(\"\\n[3] 港股行情对比:\")\nconfig3 = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\nconfig3.tiger_id = TIGER_ID\nconfig3.private_key = TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\nconfig3.language = Language.zh_CN\nconfig3.account = \"21409378833585169\"\ntry:\n    q3 = QuoteClient(config3)\n    briefs = q3.get_stock_briefs([\"00700\", \"09988\"])\n    if briefs is not None and len(briefs) > 0:\n        for b in briefs:\n            sym = b.get('symbol', 'N/A')\n            price = b.get('latest_price', 'N/A')\n            name = b.get('name', 'N/A')\n            change_pct = b.get('change_percent', 'N/A')\n            print(f\"  ✅ {sym} ({name}): HK${price} ({change_pct}%)\")\n    else:\n        print(\"  ❌ 返回空\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ {str(e)[:150]}\")\n\n# 组合4: 查看 quote 权限\nprint(\"\\n[4] 查询行情权限:\")\ntry:\n    q4 = QuoteClient(config3)\n    perms = q4.get_quote_permission()\n    print(f\"  权限: {perms}\")\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"  ❌ {str(e)[:150]}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1736,"output":1954,"cacheRead":106816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":110506,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779204387127}}
{"type":"message","id":"79720968","parentId":"8a05b1af","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:26:51.278Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ae391e03e1324c6e98c340a5","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"============================================================\n🐯 美股行情测试 - 用不同域名/账户组合\n============================================================\n\n[1] 生产域名 + 模拟账户:\n  ❌ code=4 msg=4000:permission denied(Current user and device do not have permissions in the US market)\n\n[2] 生产域名 + 实盘账户:\n  ❌ code=4 msg=4000:permission denied(Current user and device do not have permissions in the US market)\n\n[3] 港股行情对比:\n  ❌ 'str' object has no attribute 'get'\n\n[4] 查询行情权限:\n  权限: [{'name': 'hkStockQuoteLv2', 'expire_at': -1}, {'name': 'aStockQuoteLv1', 'expire_at': -1}]\n\n============================================================"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1588,"aggregated":"============================================================\n🐯 美股行情测试 - 用不同域名/账户组合\n============================================================\n\n[1] 生产域名 + 模拟账户:\n  ❌ code=4 msg=4000:permission denied(Current user and device do not have permissions in the US market)\n\n[2] 生产域名 + 实盘账户:\n  ❌ code=4 msg=4000:permission denied(Current user and device do not have permissions in the US market)\n\n[3] 港股行情对比:\n  ❌ 'str' object has no attribute 'get'\n\n[4] 查询行情权限:\n  权限: [{'name': 'hkStockQuoteLv2', 'expire_at': -1}, {'name': 'aStockQuoteLv1', 'expire_at': -1}]\n\n============================================================","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779204411274}}
{"type":"message","id":"0da19859","parentId":"79720968","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:27:04.863Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Very important findings!\n\n1. US stock quotes still return \"permission denied\" for both paper and live accounts\n2. HK stock quotes now fail with `'str' object has no attribute 'get'` - meaning the API returns data but in a different format than expected (the return is a string, not a dict)\n3. **Critical discovery**: The quote permissions show:\n   - `hkStockQuoteLv2` (Hong Kong Level 2) - **free, permanent** (expire_at: -1)\n   - `aStockQuoteLv1` (A-Share Level 1) - **free, permanent** (expire_at: -1)\n   - **NO US stock permissions!**\n\nSo the user's code claiming \"free L1 US stock quotes\" is incorrect for this account. The account only has free HK L2 and A-Share L1 permissions.\n\nLet me fix the HK quote parsing and report findings to VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7034beeaecd9449da46157a6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 修复港股解析 - 查看返回数据结构\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nfrom tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\nfrom tigeropen.tiger_open_config import TigerOpenClientConfig\nfrom tigeropen.common.consts import Language\n\nTIGER_ID = \"20159412\"\nTIGER_PRIVATE_KEY = \"\"\n\nconfig = TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)\nconfig.tiger_id = TIGER_ID\nconfig.private_key = TIGER_PRIVATE_KEY\nconfig.language = Language.zh_CN\nconfig.account = \"21409378833585169\"\nq = QuoteClient(config)\n\n# 查看港股返回的原始类型\nbriefs = q.get_stock_briefs([\"00700\", \"09988\"])\nprint(f\"返回类型: {type(briefs)}\")\nprint(f\"返回值: {briefs}\")\nif briefs:\n    for i, b in enumerate(briefs):\n        print(f\"\\n--- Item {i} ---\")\n        print(f\"类型: {type(b)}\")\n        print(f\"值: {b}\")\n        if hasattr(b, '__dict__'):\n            print(f\"属性: {vars(b)}\")\n\n# 查看权限详情\nprint(\"\\n\\n=== 行情权限详情 ===\")\nperms = q.get_quote_permission()\nfor p in perms:\n    name = p.get('name', 'N/A')\n    expire = p.get('expire_at', 'N/A')\n    print(f\"  {name}: {'永久' if expire == -1 else f'到期 {expire}'}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n\\n=== 完整权限列表 ===\")\nimport json\nprint(json.dumps(perms, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1912,"output":1380,"cacheRead":108544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111836,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779204411280}}
