{"type":"message","id":"a355c4f3","parentId":"6eb1e1f7","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:27:36.440Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Very interesting findings:\n\n1. **HK Stock Permission**: `hkStockQuoteLv2` - free, permanent ✅\n2. **A-Share Permission**: `aStockQuoteLv1` - free, permanent ✅\n3. **US Stock Real-time**: Permission denied ❌\n4. **US Stock Historical K-line**: Works! ✅\n\nSo the key finding is:\n- US stock real-time quotes need permission\n- US stock historical K-line data (get_bars) is FREE and works!\n\nLet me report this to VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"重要发现！让我回复 VAN："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7bb0b5532e244777978e911c","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683","message":"🐯 **Tiger 行情权限测试结果**\n\n📊 **当前已开通权限：**\n- ✅ `hkStockQuoteLv2` — 港股 L2（永久免费）\n- ✅ `aStockQuoteLv1` — A股 L1（永久免费）\n- ❌ 美股实时行情 — **未开通**\n\n📋 **实测结果：**\n\n| 功能 | 港股 | A股 | 美股 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 实时行情 | ✅ HK L2 免费 | ✅ CN L1 免费 | ❌ 需开通 |\n| 历史K线 | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ **免费可用** |\n\n**关键发现：美股历史K线免费可用！**\nAAPL 最近5日K线数据已成功获取：\n```\n日期       开盘    收盘    最高    最低    成交量\n05/12    293.50  298.87  300.92  293.50  52.68M\n05/13    299.82  298.21  300.45  295.38  35.32M\n05/14    297.90  300.23  303.20  296.52  54.86M\n05/15    300.24  297.84  300.66  294.91  34.48M\n05/16    296.97  297.08  300.51  296.35  13.02M\n```\n\n💡 **方案：**\n- 美股实时行情 → Finnhub（免费）\n- 美股历史K线 → Tiger（免费）\n- 港股/A股实时 → Tiger（免费）\n- 交易 → Tiger 模拟盘\n\n你的脚本里的 `Region`/`Env` 在 Python SDK v3.5.8 中不存在，需要用 `TigerOpenClientConfig(sandbox_debug=False)` 代替。要我帮你修正脚本吗？🦞"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":2379,"output":834,"cacheRead":109184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112397,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779204445766}}
