",\n  \"result\": \"## Command Line Interface (CLI)\\n## Installation\\n## Configuration\\n## Global Options\\n## Stock Quotes\\n## Stock Scanner\\n## Options Data\\n## Futures Data\\n## Capital Flow\\n## Fundamental Data\\n## Order Management\\n## Positions\\n## Transaction History\\n## Account Information\\n## Real-Time Streaming\\n## Configuration Management\\n## Other Commands\\n## Output Formats\\n## Rate Limits\\nThe Tiger OpenAPI Python SDK provides a tigeropen command-line tool that allows you to ...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (browser): {\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/skill\"\n}\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (browser): {\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/skill\",\n  \"result\": \"## AI Skill Plugin\\n## Installation\\n## Prerequisites\\n## Skill Modules\\n## Usage Examples\\n## How It Works\\n## Supported AI Tools\\n## Repository\\nTiger OpenAPI provides an AI Skill plugin that follows the Agent Skills open standard, supporting 40+ AI coding tools including Claude Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI, GitHub Copilot, VS Code, OpenAI Codex, and more.\\nOnce installed, AI tools can help you query market data, place orders, manage accounts, and more through natura...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (browser): {\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/ratelimit\"\n}\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (browser): {\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/ratelimit\",\n  \"result\": \"## Rate Limits\\n## Rate Limiting Rules\\n## High-Frequency Interface List (120 times/minute)\\n## Medium-Frequency Interface List (60 times/minute)\\n## Low-Frequency Interface List (10 times/minute)\\nTo protect the server and prevent malicious attacks, all interfaces that need to send requests to the Tiger Brokers OpenAPI server have frequency limitations.\\nRate limits are applied at the tigerId + method level, meaning each tigerId has an independent quota for ea...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (browser): {\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/trade-rules\"\n}\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (browser): {\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"targetId\": \"DF674514C99A043BFD3BEF081A048A33\",\n  \"url\": \"https://docs-en.itigerup.com/docs/trade-rules\",\n  \"result\": \"## Order and Trading Rules\\n## Trading Hours\\n## Trading Order Types\\n## Order Types Supported by Each Market\\nA-Shares\\nOnly when all three trading markets (Shanghai, Shenzhen, and Hong Kong) are open can Shanghai-Hong Kong Stock Connect and Shenzhen-Hong Kong Stock Connect trading be conducted. The trading hours for Shanghai-Hong Kong Stock Connect and Shenzhen-Hong Kong Stock Connect are: trading days when all 3 markets (Shanghai, Shenzhen, Hong Kong) are ...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (browser): {\n  \"ok\": true\n}\n- Assistant: 文档已全部吃透！以下是 **Tiger OpenAPI 完整知识总结**：\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Tiger OpenAPI 完整文档总结\n\n### 1️⃣ **AI 集成三件套**\n\n| 工具 | 用途 | 安装方式 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| **MCP Server** | 给 Claude/Cursor 等 AI 工具直接调用 | `uvx tigermcp` |\n| **CLI** | 命令行查询行情/交易，无需写代码 | `tigeropen quote briefs AAPL` |\n| **AI Skill Plugin** | Agent Skills 标准，40+ AI 工具支持 | `npx skills add tigerfintech/tigeropen-skill` |\n\n**MCP Server 配置：**\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"tigermcp\": {\n      \"command\": \"uvx\",\n      \"args\": [\"--python\", \"3.13\", \"tigermcp\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"TIGEROPEN_TIGER_ID\": \"20159412\",\n        \"TIGEROPEN_PRIVATE_KEY\": \"你...\n- User: System: [2026-05-19 11:25:42 GMT+8] Exec failed (mild-har, signal SIGTERM)\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f89f92628bcc4c82ba6c44f678\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 11:39 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f89f92628bcc4c82ba6c44f678]\nVAN: Mcp接入后与现在有什么区别\n- Assistant: **现在的架构 vs MCP 接入后：**\n\n| 对比项 | 🔴 现在 | 🟢 MCP 接入后 |\n|--------|---------|--------------|\n| **调用方式** | 我写 Python 代码 → exec 执行 → 解析输出 | AI 自动调用 MCP 工具 → 直接返回结构化数据 |\n| **响应速度** | 每次 ~3-5秒（启动 Python 解释器） | ~1秒（常驻进程，直接调用） |\n| **代码维护** | 需要我自己写/维护 `tiger_client.py` | Tiger 官方维护，自动更新 |\n| **错误处理** | 我手动 try/catch | MCP 协议标准化错误码 |\n| **功能覆盖** | 我写了 9 个函数 | **40+ 完整 API**（期权、期货、算法单全有） |\n| **实时推送** | ❌ 不支持（只能轮询） | ✅ 支持订阅推送（报价、订单状态） |\n| **CLI 工具** | ❌ 没有 | ✅ `tigeropen quote briefs AAPL` 直接用 |\n\n**简单说：**\n\n```\n现在：你说\"查腾讯行情\" → 我写代码 → 跑脚本 → 解析 → 回复你\nMCP后：你说\"查腾讯行情\" → 我直接调 MCP 工具 → 秒回\n```\n\n**最大价值：**\n1. **实时推送** — ...\n\n<workspace-critical-rules>\n## Every Session\n\nBefore doing anything else:\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who you are\n2. Read `USER.md` — this is who Captain is\n3. Read `IDENTITY.md` — this is your identity\n4. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\n5. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with Captain): Also read `MEMORY.md`\n\n**🔄 自动记忆（新增）**\n\n在任何重要对话后，自动写入记忆文件，无需用户提醒：\n\n### 自动记忆触发场景：\n\n| 场景 | 触发条件 | 执行命令 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 用户偏好 | 检测到\"我喜欢\"、\"我偏好\"、\"我的风格\" | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"preference\" \"用户喜欢保守型策略，单笔最大亏损2%\"` |\n| 重要决策 | 交易决策、策略选择 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"decision\" \"决定平仓 A50，盈利 +2%\"` |\n| 学到知识 | 解释新概念、分析新市场 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"knowledge\" \"学习到缠论第三类买点的确认方法\"` |\n| 错误教训 | 失败、报错、用户纠正 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"error\" \"之前的止损设置太紧，导致被频繁止损\"` |\n| 市场观察 | 重要新闻、价格突破 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"observation\" \"比特币突破 $73,000，恐惧贪婪指数 11\"` |\n| 对话记录 | 用户明确要求记录 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"conversation\" \"用户询问关于黄金的投资策略\"` |\n\n### 自动记忆关键字检测：\n\n以下关键字出现时，自动判断需要写入记忆：\n- **偏好类**: 记住、重要、偏好、喜欢、习惯、风格\n- **决策类**: 决定、决策、策略、交易计划、平仓、开仓\n- **知识类**: 学习、学到、理解、明白了\n- **错误类**: 错误、失败、不要、避免、注意、警告\n- **观察类**: 注意到、观察到、发现\n\n**注意**:\n- 不要等待用户说\"记住这个\"\n- 自动检测并记录重要信息\n- 记忆文件：`workspace/memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`（每日记忆）+ `workspace/MEMORY.md`（长期记忆）\n\nDon't ask permission. Just do it.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Don't exfiltrate private data. Ever.\n- Don't run destructive commands without asking.\n- `trash` > `rm` (recoverable beats gone forever)\n- When in doubt, ask Captain.\n</workspace-critical-rules>","firstKeptEntryId":"2debc7b7","tokensBefore":113023,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":true}
