{"type":"message","id":"6d3f47cf","parentId":"c0e8587b","timestamp":"2026-05-19T16:21:48.303Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the routing setup. There are two providers:\n1. **coze** - Coze platform with multiple models (auto, Kimi K2.5, GLM 4.7, DeepSeek 3.2, 豆包系列)\n2. **xiaomimimo** - Xiaomi MiMo with multiple models (mimo-v2.5-pro, mimo-v2.5, etc.)\n\nThe current model is `xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5-pro` which routes to the xiaomimimo provider.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"当前路由机制：\n\n**🧠 模型提供商（2个）：**\n\n| Provider | Base URL | 可用模型 |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **coze** | Coze 集成平台 | auto, Kimi K2.5, GLM 4.7, DeepSeek 3.2, 豆包 1.8, 豆包 2.0 Pro/Lite/Mini |\n| **xiaomimimo** | xiaomimimo.com | mimo-v2.5-pro (旗舰), mimo-v2.5 (主力), mimo-v2-pro, mimo-v2-omni, TTS 系列 |\n\n**🔀 当前路由：**\n```\n输入 → OpenClaw → xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5-pro → 响应\n```\n\n**路由格式：** `provider/model-id`\n\n切换示例：\n- `coze/auto` — Coze 自动选模型\n- `coze/deepseek-v3-2-251201` — DeepSeek 3.2\n- `coze/doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215` — 豆包 2.0 Pro（带推理）\n- `xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5` — MiMo V2.5 主力版\n\n全部 **cost: 0**（免费）。需要切换模型吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1899,"output":551,"cacheRead":67392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69842,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779207698335}}
